      "writtenOn": "2021-06-22T16:32:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "fvp_mini and fvp are hidden targets (not visible in lunch, but they are there) that use Arm FVP to run Android as an alternative to the emulator. These targets create the usual images one would expect (system, userdata, etc.).\n\nlunch fvp_mini \u0026\u0026 m",
