      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-22T18:28:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How do they create the boot images? The boot images are created in Soong and if there are no boot jars on which to perform a boot jars check then there aren\u0027t any to build a boot image either.",
      "parentUuid": "db25bfdb_3ef0ce41",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 25
      },
      "revId": "9ffbecc2c8e8a3705d922517b17c98db13d6cfcc",
